def iteration1(net, h, c):
    """ITERATION 1 (64 nodes): edges and fibres. Bright rim on the arch edge with a dark groove just outside, fibres that HUG the arch edge in the funnel (arch shaped lines converging to the base), a lip on top of the block, chevron streaks inside the arch (lines at +-60 degrees from the axis), mottled texture on the funnel and the block from Turing patterns."""
